# Eddie Brock // Venom, Lethal Protector. Turn 1: Eddie enters (no graveyard card to return). Turn 3: Bot1 pays {3}{B}{R}{G} and transforms
# him into Venom, a 5/5 with menace, trample and haste - the same permanent (CR 701.27f). Turn 7: Bot1 casts a second Grizzly Bears and
# attacks with Venom: "Whenever Venom attacks, you may sacrifice another creature. If you do, draw X cards, then you may put a
# permanent card with mana value X or less from your hand onto the battlefield, where X is the sacrificed creature's mana value."
# The sacrificed Bears are 2, so two cards are drawn - Lightning Bolt and Ornithopter. Of the hand, Hill Giant (4) is too big and
# Lightning Bolt is not a permanent card (both refused), no two cards may be put (refused), and the first Grizzly Bears, with mana
# value exactly X, goes onto the battlefield untapped (CR 202.3, 608.2h, 110.4a).

